    skos:hasTopConcept apqc:element-10004;
    skos:editorialNote "Loaded so far: category 3.0 Market and Sell Products and Services. Load the other categories from a licensed copy; check numbering against PCF 8.0."@en;
    terms:description "The read-only reference registry of the APQC Cross-Industry Process Classification Framework (PCF) 7.2.1 (D25). Each element keeps its APQC name, hierarchy number (skos:notation) and element ID (dct:identifier), and names the one domain that owns it. Domain taxonomies link their process kinds to it; internal domain services are built on it. External services follow the HR Services & PEO Enterprise Business Model instead."@en;
    terms:title "APQC Process Classification Framework Taxonomy"@en;
    terms:creator "Jeffrey Wallk" .
  
